<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Dataset/DatasetAvailabilityType/registration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dataset is not publicly available and an email registration is required before accessing the dataset, although without an affirmative acceptance of terms."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipCompleteness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates whether a relationship is known to be complete, incomplete, or if no assertion is made with respect to relationship completeness."@en .
